		PRINTFORMDW A blue-haired %PRINT_MALE("man", 93)% sits on what seems to be a wheelchair, a damp towel draped over %HIS_HER(93, 0)% lap.
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMDW A blue-haired Mermaid sits on a \@ OUTROOF(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置) ? rock # chair \@.
	ENDIF
	SIF IS_MALE(93)
		GOTO INTROBOOBSKIP_NORMAL
	SELECTCASE TALENT:93:バストサイズ
	CASE IS < 0
		PRINTFORMDW Even from a fair distance you can notice that %HIS_HER(93, 0)% chest is almost non-existent, if existent at all.
	CASE 0 ;couldn't make those lines fit, so lets just now show them
		;PRINTFORMDL You can't help but notice that %HIS_HER(93, 0)% chest is not too big, not too small.
		;PRINTFORMDW They show themselves as reasonably scaled bumps over %HIS_HER(93, 0)% %SHOW_TOP(93, 1)%.
	CASE 1
		PRINTFORMDL You find yourself pleasantly surprised at %HIS_HER(93, 0)% tastefully big pair of breasts%COND_STR(" as they press against the dock", K93_ISINMISTYLAKE())%.
		PRINTFORMDW "Nice", you think to yourself.
	CASEELSE
		PRINTFORMDL You can't stop yourself from being utterly astonished by the size of the woman's breasts as they \@ K93_ISINMISTYLAKE() ? completely rest over the dock # sit over %HIS_HER(93, 0)% covered lap \@.
		IF GET_MAPID(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置) == 2
			PRINTFORMDW What have they been feeding %HIM_HER(93, 0)%? What have they been putting on the Human Village's water supply?
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDW Just what have they been feeding %HIM_HER(93, 0)%? Could there be something in the water %HE_SHE(93, 0)% swims in?
		ENDIF
	ENDSELECT
	PRINTL
	$INTROBOOBSKIP_NORMAL
	PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% suddenly turns %HIS_HER(93, 0)% stare towards you.
	PRINTFORMDL %HIS_HER(93, 1)% wandering gaze transforms itself into a bright smile and with a beckoning wave.
	PRINTFORMW 「Hello～」
	PRINTFORMDL %HIS_HER(93, 1)% voice, gentle as it is, barely even reaches you.
	PRINTFORMDW It would be rude to walk away now, so you decide to approach and properly introduce yourself.
	PRINTFORMW 「Pleasured to meet you. Your name is...?」
	PRINTFORMDL "%CALLNAME:MASTER%", you tell %HIM_HER(93, 0)%.
	PRINTFORMW 「"%CALLNAME:MASTER%"...? %CALLNAME:MASTER%-san has a nice ring to it!」
	IF K93_ISINMISTYLAKE()
		PRINTFORMW 「I am %CALLNAME:93%, the Mermaid residing in the Misty Lake.」
		PRINTFORMDL Wait, now that %HE_SHE(93, 0)% mentioned "mermaid"...
		PRINTFORMDW Looking deeper into the water, you notice the shape of a large fish tail, faintly swinging from side to side.
		PRINTFORMDW Not to mention the fin-shaped ears...! %HE_SHE(93, 1)% is a mermaid!
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW The surprise of %HIS_HER(93, 0)% species aside, you try your luck with %HIS_HER(93, 0)% name.
	ELSEIF GET_MAPID(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置) == 2
		PRINTFORMW 「I am %CALLNAME:93%, the Mermaid of the Misty Lake, located not too far from here.」
		PRINTFORMDW Wait, now that %HE_SHE(93, 0)% mentioned "mermaid"...
		PRINTFORMDL Looking down towards %HIS_HER(93, 0)% feet, you notice the tip of a large fishtail, faintly swinging from side to side.
		PRINTFORMDW Not to mention the fin-shaped ears, too...
		PRINTFORMW 「Oh dear, I said too much. %K93_HONORIFIC(73)% will be mad...!」
		PRINTFORMDL The undercover mermaid nervously giggles.
		PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... I am sure you can keep this a secret.」
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW The surprise of %HIS_HER(93, 0)% species aside, you try your luck with %HIS_HER(93, 0)% name.
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「I am %CALLNAME:93%, the Mermaid of the Misty Lake. I am sure you have heard of it?」
		PRINTFORMDW %HIS_HER(93, 1)% scaly lower half and fin-like ears confirm it, %HE_SHE(93, 0)% is indeed a mermaid.
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW That much is obvious, so you try your luck with %HIS_HER(93, 0)% name.
	ENDIF
	CALL K93_E_NICKNAMESETCOMMENT
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMDW As much as it would be nice to stay, you have somewhere else to be right now.
	PRINTFORML 「But say, %CALLNAME:MASTER%-san...」
	PRINTFORMDW However, before you can turn around and leave, %K93NICK()% calls out to you, softly almost as if in a whisper.
	PRINTFORML 「You see, because of my body, I rarely get to see new faces.」
	PRINTFORMW 「But you may go if you want to, I wouldn't want to keep you here against your will.」
ENDIF
RETURN 1

@K93_BEFORETRAIN
;Function to be loaded at the start of the day, or more precisely, at the time of the visitation decision, uncomment it when using it.
;If you use this function, uncomment it out.
;However, it is advisable to set a condition for "read every morning without exception".
