;==================================================
;Hatching, added
;Replaces the birth event for egg-laying characters.
;these are all pretty copypaste-y, but i don't have enough in me to do it properly
;not proud of it and i'll come back to these some day
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_HATCHING(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
;ARG:1 is the first child being hatched.
;CFLAG:LatestChildCount is the number of children being hatched.
;To get the ID of any particular child in a multiple hatching, use LATEST_CHILD(Character,Number), with Number = 2 being the second child for example.
;Use CFLAG:BirthEventsCount to get whether this is the first, second, etc time hatching children. If it's her first time, it'll be 1.
;FLAG:EGGNANCY checks whether the eggs were laid after conception or just before birth.
;--------------------------------------------------
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	PRINTL
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character gives birth, has Love
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		$WAGGY_HAPPYEGGBIRTH
		PRINTFORMDW Late at night, %K93NICK()% brings your attention to %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eggs, that had started to tremble as if they were about to hatch.
		PRINTFORMDW You decide to call %CALLNAME:73% and %CALLNAME:63% over to help for what's to come.
		CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(360, "w", 1) ;it's going to cap at 25 anyway
		PRINTFORMDW After a couple of hours, %K93NICK()%'s roe hatches healthy \@ IS_NONHUMAN(MASTER) ? half-mermaid # human-mermaid \@ babies.
		SELECTCASE CFLAG:93:BirthEventsCount
		CASE 1 ;first child
			PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:63% takes %CALLNAME:73% away with %HIM_HER(63, 0)% to give you some space.
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% looks at you with a bright grin as you walk closer to both %HIM_HER(93, 0)% and the babies.
			PRINTFORMW 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%... Here they all are, safe and sound.」
			PRINTFORMDL You look at your newborn children, wrapped in warm blankets and resting close to their mother.
			PRINTFORMDW They all seem to have inherited %K93NICK()%'s ear fins, but looking down you also notice a pair of human feet.
			PRINTFORMW 「It seems that our little ones have taken a few traits from both me and you.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Unlike their mother, they can walk on land while still being able to breathe underwater!」
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% looks at the sleeping children with a warm smile.
			PRINTFORMW 「But say, after all the love you have given me... I think it's finally time I give it back to you.」
			PRINTFORMW 「And I plan to... No, and we all plan to give it all back to you a thousandfold times more.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I look forward to being a good mother to our children, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, right by your side...」
		CASE 2 ;second child
			PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:63% and %CALLNAME:73% both walk over, prompting you to get up from your seat.
			CALL CHARA_TEXT(73,@"「That took a damn while, but they all fell asleep, finally.」", "w")
			CALL CHARA_TEXT(63,@"「We'll be leaving now, we aren't part of the family, after all!」", "w")
			PRINTFORMDW You walk towards %K93NICK()% with a brisk pace, anxious to receive your second batch of children.
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% gives you a warm smile as you get closer.
			PRINTFORMW 「Look, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%! Everything went well, just like last time.」
			PRINTFORMDW You look towards your children, all bundled in a warm blankets and resting around their mother.
			PRINTFORMDW While they have inherited a few of %K93NICK()%'s mermaidisms, you also see faint outlines of little two legs under each of their blankets.
			PRINTFORMW 「And our little babies looks so cute as well, don't they～?」
			PRINTFORML 「Fufufu... This is all so good that it almost feels like a dream...」
			PRINTFORMW 「But what we have here is real, and I couldn't ask for anything better.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I look forward to raising these children by your side, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
		CASE IS >= 3 ;third child and beyond
			PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:63% and %CALLNAME:73% are sitting by %HIS_HER(93, 0)% side, closely observing your newborn children.
			SELECTCASE RAND:3
			CASE 0
				CALL CHARA_TEXT(63,@"「They all look so cute～! You and %CALLNAME:MASTER% did an awesome job with these ones～!」", "w")
				CALL CHARA_TEXT(73,@"「W-well yeah, these things do look a little bit adorable, but...」", "l")
			CASE 1
				CALL CHARA_TEXT(73,@"「Hey, Hime, do have you have a name for them yet?」", "w")
				CALL CHARA_TEXT(73,@"「I know some very cool names that I could lend to you, enough for all of them.」", "w")
				CALL CHARA_TEXT(63,@"「I have a few of my own as well, but first I think we should...」", "l")
			CASE 2
				CALL CHARA_TEXT(73,@"「I know babies are cute and all, but how many more of these will you two pump out?」", "w")
				CALL CHARA_TEXT(63,@"「Banki! That isn't something you should ask!」", "w")
				CALL CHARA_TEXT(73,@"「Come on now, it's gotta be hard to feed so many mouths at once...」", "l")
			ENDSELECT
			PRINTFORMDW They stop as soon as they see you coming, getting up and making plenty of space for you.
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()%'s lips rise in a warm smile when you sit by %HIS_HER(93, 0)% side.
			PRINTFORMW 「Here, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%. Come and take a closer look.」
			PRINTFORMDW Your children are warmly bundled in blankets, peacefully sleeping by their mother's side.
			PRINTFORMDW They possess a beautiful fin-shaped ears on their heads, while also sporting a pair of stubby of human legs.
			PRINTFORML 「Fufufu, just like the other ones, isn't %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, ARG:1)%?」
			PRINTFORMW 「%SPLIT_G(@"I can't wait to see what the future holds for this one:I hope we get to raise this one as well as the others:What a beautiful face our little baby has:This almost feels like a dream")%...」
		ENDSELECT
		IF RAND:2 && K93_ISPREGNANCYDESIRABLE() && CFLAG:93:BirthEventsCount >= 2
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORML 「Say, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, I know this might be too early but...」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% gently pulls on your sleeve as you're resting by %HIS_HER(93, 0)% side.
			PRINTFORMW 「Would you like to have \@ PREGNANCY_MULTIPLES(93) ? more babies # another baby \@ with me?」
			PRINTFORMW 「N-not right now, of course. But I would like for us try as soon as we are able to.」
			PRINTFORMW 「After experiencing such happiness... I simply want to do it again, as soon as possible!」
			PRINTFORMW 「That's not a strange desire at all, is it?」
			CALL K93_MARRYANDREPRODUCE
		ENDIF
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character gives birth, has Lust
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
		GOTO WAGGY_HAPPYEGGBIRTH
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character gives birth, has neither Love nor Lust
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 3
		SIF TALENT:93:恋人 ;lovers
			GOTO WAGGY_HAPPYEGGBIRTH
		PRINTFORMDL Very early in the morning, %CALLNAME:73% and %CALLNAME:63% approach you, asking that you go and see %K93NICK()%.
		PRINTFORMDW It seems that %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eggs have hatched with your children, giving you no choice but to follow them.
		CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(, "w")
		CALL CHARA_TEXT(63,@"「They are all right over there, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」", "w")
		PRINTFORMDW Both %CALLNAME:63% and %CALLNAME:73% leave without saying another word.
		PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% gives you a meek smile as you get closer to %HIM_HER(93, 0)%.
		PRINTFORML 「Here %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%. Look at them as much as you want...」
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% nods towards the children, warmly wrapped in thick blankets and laying around %HIM_HER(93, 0)%.
		PRINTFORMDW They sport both fin-shaped ears and a pair of stubby human legs, despite being born from roe.
		PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... Don't you agree that they look a lot like you?」
		PRINTFORMW 「Such innocent, small, precious living beings we have here under our care...」
		PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% leans in a bit closer to the newborn babies and gently whispers to their ears.
		PRINTFORMW 「I promise to love all of you with all of my heart, and raise you all with all of my love.」
		PRINTFORMW 「And I promise that I have more than enough for all of you, too.」
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character gives birth, doesn't realize you're the one who fertilized the egg
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 4
		PRINTFORMDW Late at night, %K93NICK()%'s eggs started to tremble, the children inside quickly breaking out one after the other.
		PRINTFORMDW Luckily, %CALLNAME:73% and %CALLNAME:63% were there to aid %HIM_HER(93, 0)% with taking care of them all.
		CALL K93_TIMEPASSDOTS(360, "w", 1)
		PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% is able to hatch all the eggs safely with the help of %CALLNAME:73% and %CALLNAME:63%.
		PRINTFORMDW They are all sitting close to each other, resting and exchanging small talk.
		IF CFLAG:93:BirthEventsCount == 1
			PRINTFORMW 「I'm so happy that everything went so well!」
			PRINTFORMW 「And look, %HE_SHE_CHILD(93, 0, ARG:1)% a pair of legs, just a like a human, despite being born from roe...」
			CALL CHARA_TEXT(73,@"「Uhhh... Weirdness aside, I think we should try to find the father as fast as possible.」", "w")
			PRINTFORMW 「While I do agree... How do you plan on doing that, %K93_HONORIFIC(73)%?」
			CALL CHARA_TEXT(73,@"「You don't need to worry about that, Hime. I'll find a way.」", "w")
			CALL CHARA_TEXT(63,@"「Mhmhmm, I will look around on my own as well, and we'll make him pay!」", "w")
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Fwaaah... I'm happy to know everything turned out well.」
			PRINTFORMW 「%K93_HONORIFIC(73)%, are you going to try to find the father again?」
			PRINTFORMDL %CALLNAME:73% stands up and speaks with a firm tone.
			CALL CHARA_TEXT(73,@"「No need for that. I have no doubts that it's %CALLNAME:MASTER% again.」", "w")
			PRINTFORMDL %CALLNAME:63% lets out a sigh, %HIS_HER(63, 0)% hanging low.
			CALL CHARA_TEXT(63,@"「It's still good to be sure, especially with things like this...」", "w")
		ENDIF
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1

;==================================================
;Egg laying, added
;Called when an egg-laying character conceives and lays a fertilized egg.
;If FLAG:EGGNANCY is on, the normal pregnancy event is called instead.
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_LAY_EGG(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
;ARG:1 is the number of eggs being laid.
;--------------------------------------------------
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	PRINTL
	IF FLAG:EGGNANCY ;text in regular pregnancy works for eggnancy just fine me thinks
		CALL M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_24(ARG,ARG:1)
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character has Love
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		$WAGGY_HAPPYEGGING
		SELECTCASE TOTAL_CONCEPTION_COUNT(93)
		CASE 1 ;first child
			PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%! Look here, there is something I want you to see!」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% calls out to you with a smile, a clutch of fertilized fish eggs on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% cupped palms.
			PRINTFORMW 「They came out this morning, and they seem to be growing already...」
			IF CFLAG:93:K93EN_DESIRESPREGGO
				PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... Being the mother to your children makes me so, so happy!」
				PRINTFORMW 「It's just what I wanted from our union, really.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Even though I wasn't expecting this, being the mother to your children makes me very happy.」
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% eagerly inches closer, looking at the new life resting inside the roe.
			PRINTFORMW 「I don't know what our %BABYPLNOUN("child",93)% will even look like, held inside these...」
			PRINTFORMW 「But I'm sure that everything will be okay, as long as you're there with all of us.」
		CASE 2 ;second child
			PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, look at what you did again!」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% looks at you with a soft smile, holding yet another clutch of roe on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% palms.
			IF TALENT:93:育児中 ;childcare
				PRINTFORMW 「I guess that means our \@ CHILD_MULTIPLE_COUNT(93,TALENT:93:育児中) ? young ones # %K93_CHILDHONORIFIC(93, TALENT:93:育児中)%\@ will soon have%BABYCONDSTR(" a",93,1)% little \@ RAND:2 ? brother # sister \@%BABYCONDSTR("s",93)% to play with～...」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「It's just like the last time, isn't it? I'm sure everything will go well this time, too.」
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORMW 「Either way, I hope that you are happy to be a %PRINT_MALE("father_:mother", MASTER)% for a second time.」
			PRINTFORMW 「And I hope that... you haven't found it weird that your children come from eggs.」
 		CASE IS >= 3 ;third child and beyond
			PRINTFORML 「Say, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%... Can you guess what happened～?」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% stares at you with an eyebrow playfully raised as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% holds yet another clutch of roe.
			PRINTFORMW 「That's right, it seems like you filled those eggs of mine once again.」
			PRINTFORML 「Fufufu... Our family has grown large at this point, hasn't it?」
			IF CFLAG:93:K93EN_DESIRESPREGGO
				PRINTFORMW 「But to be honest... I wouldn't mind making it even bigger!」
				PRINTFORMW 「And with how many of these I lay, I'm sure that will be no problem.」
