		ELSEIF !RAND:20 ;silly easter eggs and silly funnies
			PRINTFORMDL ...!?
			PRINTFORMD It's then that you see
			PRINTDATADL
				;armored core 4 soundtracks's thinker plus a little of the game itself
				DATAFORM  a colossal suit of armor, painted in a shining white.\nThe fish in the deep waters of the lake seem to be quite fond of it.
				;sacabambaspis reconstruction
				DATAFORM  a very round fish with a rounded body, a really silly face, and googly eyes.\nYou almost can't look at it without laughing!
				;bigfin squid
				DATAFORM  a pale translucent squid with freakishly long, slender tentacles dragging along the ground.\nIt stops, and seemingly waves at you with one of its abyssal appendages.\nWhat the hell...
				;it's just a sex toy
				DATAFORM  a human bottom, sticking out in the lake's gravel!\nExcept that when you look at it closer, you notice that it's made out of silicone.\n...It's just a sex toy.
			ENDDATA
		ELSEIF !RAND:5
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMD You also see
			PRINTDATADL
				DATAFORM  an old shipwreck off in the distance.\nYou can almost make out its name, too.
				DATAFORM  The wreck of a single propeller aircraft with two big floats attached to its underside.\nSeems to fit two people, one behind the other.
				DATAFORM  a wooden chest, fully open and almost completely rotten.\nWhatever was in there was taken a long time ago.
				DATAFORM  an immense, long shadow slithering in water like a snake.\nIt scurries away as soon as it notices you staring at it.
				DATAFORM  the silhouette of a kappa, quietly floating in the waters above you.
				DATAFORM  a frog, stuck in a solid ice cube, floating in the waters above you.\n%SPLIT_G("It doesn't seem to be moving at all...:It twitches, seemingly having started to thaw out. You go, big guy!")%
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	ENDSELECT
ELSE ;anywhere else
	SELECTCASE RAND:4
	CASE 0
		PRINTFORMDL It seems that %K93NICK()% has adapted well to a life outside of water.
		IF YOGORE:(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置) < 1000 ;clean
			PRINTFORMDL As simple as this bedroom is, the cleanliness brings out a regal air.
			PRINTFORMDL The water in the Mermaid's tub is so fresh you could drink from it.
		ELSE ;dirty, probably
			PRINTFORMDL But perhaps a little too well, as piles of clothing and litter tell you so.
			PRINTFORMDL The water in %HIS_HER(93, 0)% tub could use some change, specks of dirt accumulating at its bottom.
			PRINTFORMDL Despite it all, %K93NICK()%'s stone collection sits encased in a black box, as organized as ever.
		ENDIF
	CASE 1
		PRINTFORMDL You see a cushioned chair placed by the side of one of the windows.
		PRINTFORMDL A dent on its seat tells you that %K93NICK()% quite enjoys looking outside.
	CASE 2
		GOTO WAGGY_ROOMDESC_STONE
	CASE 3
		IF CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == CFLAG:93:現在位置 && !CFLAG:93:添い寝中 ;waggy is in the same room and not co-sleeping (she would be in bed with you)
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% rests %HIS_HER(93, 0)% arms prone over the wooden tub's rims, soaking in its water.
			PRINTFORMDL All in all, %HE_SHE(93, 0)% seems to be quite content being inside it.
			SIF SHIRAHU(93)
				PRINTFORMDL Noticing your gaze, the Mermaid smiles and wiggles %HIS_HER(93, 0)% fin ears at you.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDL The water inside %K93NICK()%'s wooden tub sits almost perfectly still.
			PRINTFORMDL you wonder if sleeping in there is in any way more comfortable than sleeping in a %K93_PRINTBED()%...
		ENDIF
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
