;==================================================
;Gift events
;贈り物イベント
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_GIFT(ARG, GIFT_ID, 評価点, GIFT_NAME, SENSE)
#DIM GIFT_ID
#DIM 評価点
#DIMS GIFT_NAME
#DIMS SENSE
;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;評価点		  The gift's score (1-999).
;GIFT_NAME   The name of the gift.
;SENSE       The attributes of the gift. STRCOUNT(DISH_TASTE, "foobar/") can be used to determine them.
;GIFT_ID     The ID of the gift. You can pass this to GET_GIFTDATA() to get info about the gift.
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "回数")    The number of times the player gave the gift to the character.
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "得点")    The gift's score (1-999).
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "日付")    The date that the player gave the gift to the character (1-9999).
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "場所")    The location that the gift was bought at.
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "形容詞")  The associated adjectives (see 贈り物_形容詞.erb)
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "本体")    The price of the gift (see 贈り物_本体.erb)
;評価点       贈り物の評価点（1～999）,口上主があげた場合でも口上主の評価点
;GIFT_NAME    贈り物の名称
;SENSE        贈り物に設定された属性。STRCOUNT(DISH_TASTE, "ほげほげ/")を使うと特定の属性を判定できます。
;GIFT_ID      これ単体では使いません。以下の式内関数を使うとデータを抽出できます（こだわりたい人用）
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "回数")    貰った（あげた）回数
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "得点")    得点（1～999）,口上テンプレ内では用意されてます。
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "日付")    貰った（あげた）日付（1～9999）
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "場所")    買った場所（デートの行き先）
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "形容詞")  形容詞番号（贈り物_形容詞.erb参照）
;　GET_GIFTDATA(GIFT_ID, "本体")    本体番号（贈り物_本体.erb参照）
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;Dialogue for giving the player a gift on the way home from a date. This can happen at Intimacy 5 or higher, regardless of date score or any other factor.
;The gift will be something that the character would score from 701-999 if the player gave it to them.
;デート帰りに口上主があなたに贈り物を渡す（陥落や好感度に関わらず親密5以上から発生）
;評価点は701～999（渡すキャラ本人の評価）
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IF ARG == 1
	IF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER()
		IF !RAND:4 && !FIRSTTIME("WaggyFirstKiss", 1, 93)
			PRINTFORMW 「Oh, and before I forget... %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, look over here!」
			PRINTFORMDW You look at %K93NICK()%, only to see %HIM_HER(93, 0)% with %HIS_HER(93, 0)% lips faintly pursed.
			PRINTFORMW 「I have a little something to give to you, but I was wondering...」
			PRINTFORML 「Can you guess what it is～?」
			PRINTL
			CALL ASK_YN(@"It's obviously a kiss, so lean in and kiss %HIM_HER(93, 0)%.", "It's a gift, a physical object.")
			IF !RESULT
				PRINTFORMDL You nod and lean in, taking %K93NICK()% by surprise as you gently press your lips against %HIS_HERS(93, 0)%.
				CALL MUTUAL_KISS(93)
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% leans back, breaking your short kiss with an audible smack.
				PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... That was a good guess, but that was not what I had in mind at all～」
				PRINTFORML 「No, what I had in mind was this little gift I bought...」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDW You nod and tell %K93NICK()% that you expect a gift from %HIM_HER(93, 0)%.
				PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% pauses, smiles, and nods at you answer.
				PRINTFORMW 「That's correct, I saved up some money and bought you a gift.」
				PRINTFORML 「Here, I hope you enjoy it...」
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% hands you a box, wrapped in a fancy looking blue ribbon.
			PRINTFORMDW You unwrap and open the box, and find a %GIFT_NAME% inside.
			PRINTFORML 「So, what are your thoughts? Do you like it?」
			IF CFLAG:93:貰った贈り物 ;has a favorite gift
				CALL GIFTNAME(CFLAG:93:貰った贈り物, 93)
				PRINTFORMW 「I hope you do, just as much as I like the %RESULTS% you gifted me!」
			ELSEIF CFLAG:93:贈り物ストック ;has gift
				PRINTFORMW 「I hope you do, considering all the nice gifts you have given me!」
			ENDIF
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Oh, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%! Before I forget, I got a gift for you today!」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% smiles as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% hands you a box wrapped with a fancy blue ribbon.
			PRINTFORML 「Go on, you can open it right now...」
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% says, looking at you apprehensively.
			PRINTFORMDW You unwrap and open the box, only to find a %GIFT_NAME% inside.
			PRINTFORMW 「It was a bit difficult to choose, but are you happy with what I chose?」
			PRINTFORMDW You nod to %HIS_HER(93, 0)% question, satisfied with %HIS_HER(93, 0)% gift.
			PRINTFORML 「That's good! I would hate giving you something just for you to end up not liking it.」
			IF CFLAG:93:貰った贈り物 && !K93_COHABITATION() && RAND:2
				CALL GIFTNAME(CFLAG:93:貰った贈り物, 93)
				PRINTFORMW 「In fact, I hope you like this as much as I like that %RESULTS% gave me!」
				PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... I still have it by my stone collection, you know～?」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「After all, my beloved %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)% deserves only the best～!」
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	ELSEIF K93_YEARNING_SEXFRIEND()
		PRINTFORMDW Suddenly, you feel a light pull on your sleeve.
		PRINTFORMDL You turn your gaze towards %K93NICK()%, only to see that %HE_SHE(93, 0)% is holding something in %HIS_HER(93, 0)% hand.
		PRINTFORMW 「Uhmm... There is something that I want to give you.」
		PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% looks away as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% hands you a %GIFT_NAME%, neatly wrapped in a blue ribbon.
		PRINTFORMW 「I had a little bit of money, so I bought this for you... w-with help from %K93_HONORIFIC(73)%, of course.」
		IF CFLAG:93:貰った贈り物 ;has a favorite gift
			CALL GIFTNAME(CFLAG:93:貰った贈り物, 93)
			PRINTFORMW 「A-and of course, it wouldn't be fair to not give you something in return for that %RESULTS% you gifted me!」
		ELSEIF CFLAG:93:贈り物ストック ;has gift
			PRINTFORMW 「And of course, it wouldn't be fair to not give you something in return for all the gifts you've given me.」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「And since you've taken me out to such a nice... date, I think it's fair to give you something in return.」
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% pauses, and looks towards you again with a shy smile.
		PRINTFORMW 「Either way, I just hope you like this gift, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「Oh, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%! I almost forgot to give you this...」
		PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% hands you a %GIFT_NAME%, wrapped in a modest looking blue ribbon.
		PRINTFORMW 「I managed to save a bit of money, so I decided to get you a gift.」
		PRINTFORMW 「It isn't much, but I hope you like it!」
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;End of day event: the character cherishes the gift they received from the player (occurs if the gift had a score of 700 or more)
;一日の終わりに今日貰った贈り物を大事にする（700点以上）
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ELSEIF ARG == 2
	IF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER()
		PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)% always knows what I like best, doesn't %HE_SHE(MASTER, 0)%?」
		PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... Maybe I should give %HIM_HER(MASTER, 0)% something nice in return...」
	ELSEIF K93_YEARNING_SEXFRIEND(1)
		PRINTFORMW 「For %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)% to gift me something so nice...」
		PRINTFORMW 「I wonder, does %HE_SHE(MASTER, 0)% like me as much as I like %HIM_HER(MASTER, 0)%?」
		PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% quickly shakes %HIS_HER(93, 0)% head in an attempt to dispel that thought.
		PRINTFORMW 「No, this is just a... nice gift between friends, nothing else.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「Fufuuun～! Such a nice little gift this turned out to be～!」
		PRINTFORMW 「I should thank %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)% for it a later.」
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;End of day event: the gift the character received from the player becomes their favorite (displayed after the "cherish" lines,
; occurs if the gift had a score of 700 or more and it has the highest score of any gift the character has received)
;一日の終わりに今日貰った贈り物をお気に入りにする（↑の大事にするから続き）（700点以上かつ最高得点）
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ELSEIF ARG == 3
	IF STRCOUNT(SENSE, "身につける/") ;wearable
		PRINTFORML 「Hmmm... But I wonder how I should wear it?」
		IF IS_FALLEN(93)
			PRINTFORMW 「I would wear this all the time if I could... Fufufu!」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Maybe something only for very special occasions...」
		ENDIF
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「But now I wonder, where should I display this?」
		IF IS_FALLEN(93)
			PRINTFORMW 「Right by my collection of pretty rocks is only fitting for something so precious...」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Right by my stone collection seems to be as good of a place as any...」
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;End of day event: the character keeps the gift they received from the player (occurs if the gift had a score of 400-699)
;一日の終わりに今日貰った贈り物をとりあえず保管する（400～699点）
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ELSEIF ARG == 4
	PRINTFORMW 「Oh, this is the gift %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)% gave me earlier today.」
	IF CFLAG:93:貰った贈り物 ;has favorite gift
		CALL GIFTNAME(CFLAG:93:貰った贈り物, 93)
		PRINTFORMW 「It's a far cry from the %RESULTS% that %HE_SHE(MASTER, 0)% gave me...」
		PRINTFORML 「But it isn't bad either, so I wonder what I should do with it?」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「Hmmm... I wonder what I should do with it?」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% taps %HIS_HER(93, 0)% chin before quickly coming to a conclusion.
	PRINTFORMW 「I think it's fine if I will put it in my drawer!」
	RETURN 1
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;End of day event: the character quietly pawns the gift they received from the player (occurs if the gift had a score less than 400)
;一日の終わりに今日貰った贈り物をこっそり質に入れる（400点未満）
;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ELSEIF ARG == 5
	PRINTFORML 「This thing that %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)% gave is really not any good...」
	PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% thinks of what to do with your gift, guilty weighing heavy on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% heart.
	PRINTFORML 「I suppose I will just... give it to %K93_HONORIFIC(73)% so %HE_SHE(73, 0)% can sell it.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I-it should be okay as long as I use the money to buy something nice for %HIM_HER(MASTER, 0)%!」
	RETURN 1
ENDIF
RETURN 1

;==================================================
;Egg gift, added
;Called when an egg-laying character gives unfertilized egg(s) as a gift after a date.
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_EGG_GIFT(ARGS,ARG,ARG:1)
;ARG:1 is the number of eggs being given.
;--------------------------------------------------
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character has Love
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		PRINTFORML 「Here, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%. I hope you... get to enjoy them.」
		PRINTFORML 「Fufufu... It's a bit embarrassing, but I don't regret giving you these, not even a bit.」
		PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% covers %HIS_HER(93, 0)% mouth as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% shily giggles.
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character has Lust
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
		PRINTFORML 「Here you go, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%. These were made with a lot of care, just for you.」
		PRINTFORML 「I don't mind you eating them, after all... your mouth has been in "lower" places of mine before～!」
		PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% lets out a playful laugh, %HIS_HER(93, 0)% cheeks burning red.
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The character has neither Love nor Lust
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 3
		PRINTFORML 「H-here you go, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, I've heard these are quite valuable.」
		PRINTFORMW 「I got them from... the Misty Lake, from some fish or another!」
		PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% lets out a sigh as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% quickly looks elsewhere.
		PRINTFORMW 「Fwuuuh... This is not even the most intimate thing I've given you...」
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1

;==================================================
;Bug Battle
;Bug Battle dialogue is a bit special, and you shouldn't use PRINT statements.
;Only one line of dialogue is required in the RESULTS field.
;%MUSHI_NAME% will display the name of the bug the character is using.
;The longest bug names are 30 characters (Alexandra Trivanel Swallowtail and Orthetrum Albistylum Speciosum are tied).
;Make sure the text doesn't overflow!
;ARG lists either the number of bugs remaining or their rank, depending on the subsection.
;ムシバトル
;ムシバトルの口上は少し特殊で、PRINTを使うのではなく、
;台詞一行のみをRESULTSに入れてください
;ムシの名前は %MUSHI_NAME% で表示できます
;ムシの名前の最長はアレキサンドラトリバネアゲハの全角14文字です
;文字数制限があります。はみ出ないように気をつけてください
;ARGは残りムシ数か順位です
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EN_MESSAGE_COM_K93_MUSHI_BATTLE(ARGS, ARG)
#DIM 残りムシ数
#DIM 順位
SELECTCASE ARGS
	CASE "試合前"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;The battle begins
		;ARG is not accessible
		;No more than 50 characters per line
		;キャラセレクト時,ARGは使えません
		;全角50文字くらいまで
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			STRDATA RESULTS
				DATAFORM 「I hope this is fun! for us both!」
				DATAFORM 「I wish you good luck in this match, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
				DATAFORM 「I'm not very good at this sort of thing, but it's okay as long as we have fun!」
				DATAFORM 「This is something akin to play fighting, correct? Then, I would like to participate!」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	CASE "戦場に出した"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;Immediately after "CHARACTER sent out BUG!"
		;No more than 40 characters per line
		;"【（キャラ）】は《（ムシ）》を戦場に出した！」"の直後
		;全角40文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		残りムシ数 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			IF MUSHI_NAME == "スカイフィッシュ" ;skyFISH (need to make sure she can even use this bug, can't really find the data for it)
				STRDATA RESULTS
					DATAFORM 「"%MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%"... You're still cute, even though you don't look like one!」
					DATAFORM 「"%MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%"... I wonder, why do you have that name?」
					DATAFORM 「Is it really here? I can barely see it...」
				ENDDATA
			ELSE
				STRDATA RESULTS
					DATAFORM 「I found this bug the other day. Quite cute little thing, isn't it?」
					DATAFORM 「This bug looks cute, so it's fair to send it out!」
					DATAFORM 「Do your best, %MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%!」
					DATAFORM 「I believe in you, %MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%!」
					DATAFORM 「You can do it, %MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%!」
				ENDDATA
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	CASE "攻撃時"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;Immediately before "CHARACTER's BUG uses SKILL!"
		;No more than 40 characters per line
		;"【（キャラ）】《（ムシ）》の『（攻撃名）』！」"の直前
		;全角40文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		残りムシ数 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			IF MUSHI_NAME == "スカイフィッシュ" ;skyfish
				STRDATA RESULTS
					DATAFORM 「%MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%, show yourself to the world!」
					DATAFORM 「Let yourself be seen by all of us, %MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%!」
					;jojo reference number 4!
					DATAFORM 「I'm going to overcome you! My heart is like the... Uhm... What was the "eleven" thing again, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%?」
				ENDDATA
			ELSE
				STRDATA RESULTS
					DATAFORM 「You can do it, %MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%!」
					DATAFORM 「Don't hold back now, %MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%!」
					DATAFORM 「%MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%, let your voice be heard!」
				ENDDATA
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	CASE "倒れた時"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;Immediately after "CHARACTER's BUG faints!!"
		;No more than 40 characters per line
		;"【（キャラ）】《（ムシ）》は倒れた！！"の直後
		;全角40文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		残りムシ数 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			STRDATA RESULTS
				DATAFORM 「You did well, %MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%.」
				DATAFORM 「I'm sorry if I pushed you too hard...」
				DATAFORM 「You did your best, %MUSHI_NAME_TR(MUSHI_NAME)%. Rest easy knowing that!」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	CASE "敗退時"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;Immediately after "CHARACTER is eliminated!!"
		;No more than 40 characters per line
		;"【（キャラ）】敗退！！"の直後
		;全角40文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		残りムシ数 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			STRDATA RESULTS
				DATAFORM 「Oh, is this really it?」
				DATAFORM 「It seems that I can't go for any longer...」
				DATAFORM 「I wonder what we could have done better...」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	CASE "タイマン：勝ち"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;One-on-one battle: the character came in first
		;No more than 20 characters per line
		;順位は1位
		;全角20文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		順位 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			STRDATA RESULTS
				DATAFORM 「It looks like we won, somehow! Good job, everyone!」
				DATAFORM 「We gave our best, and we won!」
				DATAFORM 「This a lot of fun, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%! I can't wait to play with you again.」
				DATAFORM 「D-did I really win? I can barely believe it!」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	CASE "タイマン：負け"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;One-on-one battle: the character came in second
		;No more than 20 characters per line
		;順位は2位
		;全角20文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		順位 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			STRDATA RESULTS
				DATAFORM 「We really gave our bet out there, there is no reason to be sad!」
				DATAFORM 「This was fun, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, even if I didn't win...」
				DATAFORM 「Winning feels nice, doesn't it?」
				DATAFORM 「Fwaaah... You're so strong!, congratulations on your victory.」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	CASE "バトルロイヤル：優勝"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;Battle Royale: the character came in first
		;No more than 30 characters per line
		;順位は1位
		;全角30文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		順位 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			STRDATA RESULTS
				DATAFORM 「To win against so many...! Is this really happening?」
				DATAFORM 「Everyone fought so well!」
				DATAFORM 「T-that was a fun match, everyone!」
				DATAFORM 「Fwaaah... I feel somewhat embarrassed...」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	CASE "バトルロイヤル：２位以下"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;Battle Royale: the character came in 2nd, 3rd, or 4th
		;No more than 30 characters per line
		;順位は2～4位
		;全角30文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		順位 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			STRDATA RESULTS
				DATAFORM 「Competing against so many others... there was no way I would stand out...」
				DATAFORM 「Fufufu... I'm sure this is fine. I had fun, everyone.」
				DATAFORM 「Did my shyness get the best of me?」
				DATAFORM 「This was fun, with so many people around...」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	CASE "チーム戦：勝ち"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;Team battle: the character's partner was eliminated, but their team still came in first
		;No more than 32 characters per line
		;順位は1位（やられていても）
		;全角32文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		順位 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			STRDATA RESULTS
				DATAFORM 「Did you see that, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%? I led us to victory, somehow!」
				DATAFORM 「This situation sort of reminds me of a certain someone...」
				DATAFORM 「I'm sure I couldn't have done this without you, so come on, you should smile as well!」
				DATAFORM 「It was fun fighting by your side. I hope we... get to do it again.」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	CASE "チーム戦：負け"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;Team battle: the character's team came in second
		;No more than 32 characters per line
		;順位は2位
		;全角32文字まで（カギカッコ含む）
		;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
		LOCAL:1 = 1
		順位 = ARG
		;-------------------------------------------------
		IF LOCAL:1
			STRDATA RESULTS
				DATAFORM 「Was any of that my fault?」
				DATAFORM 「I'm sorry for... letting everyone down like that.」
				DATAFORM 「I hope everyone still had fun...」
				DATAFORM 「Fwaaah... It's fine if we didn't win, everything is okay as long as we all had fun!」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
ENDSELECT
SIF RESULTS != ""
	RETURN 1

;==================================================
;Gravity operation
;TCVAR: If you put a location ID in the gravitation point, the character will be pulled to that point
;Only works on the same base map as the location ID (the character won't go to the Hakurei Shrine Outskirts if they aren't at the Hakurei Shrine).
;Note that if you don't set any conditions, they will be pulled to the location permanently.
;CFLAG:今日の運勢 contains random numbers (0-999) for that day, so you use this instead of RAND, I think
;which i have tested, and there seems to be no problem with using RAND
;what did they mean by this?
;引力操作
;TCVAR:引力点に場所IDを入れるとその地点に引っ張られていきます
;場所IDと同じ拠点マップでしか効果はありません（博麗神社の境内なら拠点が博麗神社のときだけ）
;条件を付けないと永久に引っ張られ続けるので注意
;RANDは基本的に使えません。CFLAG:今日の運勢 にその日のランダム数値（0～999）が入っているのでこれを使うと良いです
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_GRAVITY(ARG)
;this is also horrible but it just works (or does it? need to test it better)

IF !RAND:6 && K93_FRIENDSHIP() && INRANGE(TIME:2, 2, 4) && CFLAG:93:現在位置 == P348霧の湖・湖底 && CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 == P347霧の湖 ;makes waggy more likely to surface if the player is around + the weather and time are favorable
	TCVAR:93:引力点 = P347霧の湖
ELSEIF GETBIT(FLAG:プール, 3) && GET_MAPID(CFLAG:93:初期位置) != 2 ;has mystery bubbles and not currently in the human village
	TCVAR:93:引力点 = 0 ;let the game handle it, pretty sure it's set to let her move around
ELSEIF !GROUPMATCH(CFLAG:93:現在位置, P347霧の湖, P348霧の湖・湖底, SUMIKOMI_ROOM, CFLAG:93:初期位置) && !CFLAG:93:同行 ;if not anywhere in the lake or not in her room and not accompanying
	IF K93_LIVINGINMISTYLAKE()
		TCVAR:93:引力点 = P347霧の湖 ;make her gravitate to the misty lake shore
	ELSE
		TCVAR:93:引力点 = CFLAG:93:初期位置 ;make her stay at home
	ENDIF
ELSE
	TCVAR:93:引力点 = 0 ;let the game do its thing
ENDIF

SIF GET_MAPID(TCVAR:93:引力点) != GET_MAPID(CFLAG:93:現在位置) ;failsafe, make sure the place we're gravitating her to is here at all, otherwise we get a crash
	TCVAR:93:引力点 = 0

;==================================================
;Watermelon Splitting
;Watermelon Splitting dialogue works like Bug Battle dialogue. Don't use PRINT statements, and only assign one line to the RESULTS field.
;Brackets are automatically added.
;Only "collision" and "result" are automatically colored.
;Lines can be no more than 26 characters except for "collision" and "result". Please be careful not to overflow!
;If you have several patterns, you can use %TEXTR( / )% to get more atmosphere.
;スイカ割り
;スイカ割りの口上はムシバトル同様、PRINTを使うのではなく、
;台詞一行のみをRESULTSに入れてください
;カギ括弧は自動で付きます
;"衝突","結果"のみ、口上色が自動で付きます
;"衝突","結果"以外は半角26文字（全角13文字）までの文字数制限があります。はみ出ないように気をつけてください
;数パターンあると雰囲気が出ます（%TEXTR( / )%を使うと良い）
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_EN_MESSAGE_COM_K93_SUIKA(ARGS, ARG)
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL:1 = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL:1
	SELECTCASE ARGS
		CASE "衝突"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;Lines for stumbling out of the field and bumping into a character
		;No character limit, and there's no generic dialogue for this.
		;場外に出てあなたがキャラと衝突した際の台詞
		;文字数制限はありません,汎用台詞もありません
		;-------------------------------------------------
			RESULTS = Fweeeh! Be more careful!
		;There!
		CASE "そこだ！"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"There, hit it!/Do it, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!")%
		;Near
		CASE "近い"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"Just a bit more!/Almost there!/You're really, really close!")%
		;Far
		CASE "遠い"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"You're just a little bit far!/Still got a long way to go, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!")%
		;Very far
		CASE "かなり遠い"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"You have no idea just how far away you are.../%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%! You're so far I can barely see you!")%
		;In front
		CASE "前"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"Just a few more steps, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!/It's right in front, just a bit more...!/That way, keep at it!")%
		;A little further ahead
		CASE "少し前"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"Just one more step, please!/It's right in front, just one more step!/You almost got it now...")%
		;Behind
		CASE "後ろ"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"No, not there! The other way!/Behind you, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!/It's not there, turn around!")%
		;A little further back
		CASE "少し後ろ"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"Right behind you, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!/Just turn back and it's right there!/Just one step back now...")%
		;Right
		CASE "右"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"To your right, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!/To the right, right!/More to the right!")%
		;A little further right
		CASE "少し右"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"Just an arm's length to your right!/It's right, very close!")%
		;Left
		CASE "左"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"To your left, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!/To the left, left!/Left, more to the left!")%
		;A little further left
		CASE "少し左"
			RESULTS = %TEXTR(@"Just an arm's length to your left.../It's left, very close!")%
		CASE "結果"
		;-------------------------------------------------
		;After the game ends
		;You can only have one line per case, but they can be as long as you want(?)
		;TFLAG:193,
		;   -1=Failure
		;    0=Success
		;    1=Great Success
		;    2=Great Success with a wooden sword (bonus points)
		;ARG
		;    0=Honest person
		;    1=Liar
		;終了後の一言
		;文字数制限はありません,汎用台詞もありません
		;TFLAG:193,
		;   -1=失敗
		;    0=成功
		;    1=大成功
		;    2=木刀で大成功（ボーナス点）
		;ARG
		;    0=正直者
		;    1=ウソつき
		;-------------------------------------------------
			IF ARG == 1 ;liar
				SELECTCASE TFLAG:193
				CASE -1
					RESULTS = Fufufu... Sorry, I just had to do it～!
				CASE 0
					RESULTS = Lying a little is part of the game, isn't it?
				CASE 1
					RESULTS = Impressive, you did even though I was lying.
				CASE 2
					RESULTS = To do it with a wooden sword even while being fooled...
				ENDSELECT
			ELSE ;honest
				SELECTCASE TFLAG:193
				CASE -1
					RESULTS = It's okay, there is always next time.
				CASE 0
					RESULTS = Fwaaah! You did it!
				CASE 1
					RESULTS = Fwaaaah! Such a clean cut!
				CASE 2
					RESULTS = To do it with a wooden sword! You're amazing!
				ENDSELECT
			ENDIF
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF

