;==================================================
;Ring bell
;You can ring a bell at the Misty Lake's shore to attempt to summon Wakasagihime to the surface
;==================================================
;ARG stores Wakasagihime's response to the bell, where 1 = she is already there, 2 = she didn't come, 3 = the summoning attempt was successful 
;ARG:1 stores if it's the first time the player character is using this command
;--------------------------------------------------
@M_KOJO_EN_EVENT_K93_RINGBELL(ARGS, ARG, ARG:1)
;Hide dialogue（=0, Hidden, =1, Shown）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	IF ARG == 1 ;this dialogue is only ever accessible for waggy if she is already there
		IF ARG:1
			PRINTFORMW 「Oh, are you only seeing that now?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Yes, if you ring this bell I will come swimming to the surface if I am able to.」
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% looks at the antique dock bell, %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes full of thought.
			PRINTFORMW 「This has been here for a long time, perhaps even before I came to be in this lake...」
			PRINTFORMW 「But it still has a nice ring to it, don't you agree?」
			RETURN 1
		ENDIF
		
		IF K93_FRIENDSHIP() && !K93_LIVINGINMISTYLAKE() && !RAND:5
			PRINTFORMW 「You know, I haven't seen that bell being used as often as it used to be anymore.」
			PRINTFORML 「Lately, I've found myself coming to the surface without anyone calling for me.」
			PRINTFORMW 「And coincidentally, that started when I began to see you as a friend...」
			IF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER()
				PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% gives you a gentle yet warm smile.
				PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... Do you think that means anything, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%～?」
			ELSEIF K93_YEARNING_SEXFRIEND()
				PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% looks away as a blush starts to flourish on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% cheeks.
				PRINTFORMW 「B-but I'm sure that doesn't mean anything special or anything!」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% gives you a shy smile.
				PRINTFORMW 「Maybe I have been looking forward to our meetings too much, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
			ENDIF
		ELSE
			PRINTDATAW
				DATAFORM 「I'm already here, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%. You don't need to ring it.」\n「Although, I don't exactly mind listening to that sound...」
				DATAFORM 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, even pleasant sounds can become unpleasant if you listen to them over and over again.」
				DATAFORM 「I wonder if you could make a song using only the ringing of bells as an instrument...」
				DATAFORM 「Yes, that sound is able to reach me all the way down in the lake.」\n「It's impressive how far sound can travel in water!」
				DATAFORM 「I wonder what was that purpose of that bell before I started using it like this...」
				DATAFORM 「%K93_HONORIFIC(63)% and %K93_HONORIFIC(73)% \@ K93_LIVINGINMISTYLAKE() ? make # made \@ good use of this bell.」\n「I always \@ K93_LIVINGINMISTYLAKE() ? come # came \@ running when either of them \@ K93_LIVINGINMISTYLAKE() ? rings # rang \@ it!」
			ENDDATA
		ENDIF
	ELSE ;META
		PRINTFORML 「Strange.... Unless something has gone wrong, you aren't supposed to hear me say this!」
		PRINTFORMW 「But if you are, please let someone know.」
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
ENDIF
RETURN 1

